(4762984, 687853, 82503, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, but it doesn''t work for me. The two cups, their position and contents indicate that this is the moment <i>before</i> some kind of chemical reaction occurs. The expressions on the kids'' faces as well as the dirt on their faces and clothing, however, looks like this was taken <i>after</i> a chemical reaction. Well, one could say that this is just one experiment in a whole series and that they''ve already been at it all afternoon, but then again the expressions don''t fit. They''re not expressions of expectation, they seem like a reaction to an unexpected event.</td>', 'Fun idea, but it doesn''t work for me. The two cups, their position and contents indicate that this is the moment before some kind of chemical reaction occurs. The expressions on the kids'' faces as well as the dirt on their faces and clothing, however, looks like this was taken after a chemical reaction. Well, one could say that this is just one experiment in a whole series and that they''ve already been at it all afternoon, but then again the expressions don''t fit. They''re not expressions of expectation, they seem like a reaction to an unexpected event.', '2008-06-11 02:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4762986, 687566, 82503, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot, but a bit of a stretch for the challenge.</td>', 'A beautiful shot, but a bit of a stretch for the challenge.', '2008-06-11 02:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
