(4762999, 687901, 56880, '<td valign="top">She looks exhausted, and is (hopefully) being helped to a chair where she can rest for a bit.  Shot from the other side, where you could see both their faces, might have shown more of the chemistry you''re looking for.</td>', 'She looks exhausted, and is (hopefully) being helped to a chair where she can rest for a bit.  Shot from the other side, where you could see both their faces, might have shown more of the chemistry you''re looking for.', '2008-06-11 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4763001, 686132, 82503, '<td valign="top">Oh my. People are not going to like this, I predict tons of 1s and maybe comments like "You glorify drug use!"<br/> <br/>It''s a good idea for the challenge, but technically I''m not thrilled by the image. And the pose seems unnatural.</td>', 'Oh my. People are not going to like this, I predict tons of 1s and maybe comments like "You glorify drug use!" It''s a good idea for the challenge, but technically I''m not thrilled by the image. And the pose seems unnatural.', '2008-06-11 02:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4763011, 687901, 82503, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this is clearly DNMC. This challenge is about the "science of chemistry".<br/> <br/>I find it a pity when I have to lower the score of a beautiful image because it doesn''t meet the challenge. However, here I don''t have this problem. This picture is more of a snapshot. The composition is random, we cannot see the couple''s faces and the background is full of distractions. I really don''t understand why you submitted this image.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this is clearly DNMC. This challenge is about the "science of chemistry". I find it a pity when I have to lower the score of a beautiful image because it doesn''t meet the challenge. However, here I don''t have this problem. This picture is more of a snapshot. The composition is random, we cannot see the couple''s faces and the background is full of distractions. I really don''t understand why you submitted this image.', '2008-06-11 02:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4763015, 687491, 82503, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Good composition, pose, lighting, DOF. And your model even has a typical "scientist face" with the glasses and all. ;-) <br/> <br/>I was planning to do something similar, but didn''t have time in the end. I want to see this one on the front page!</td>', 'Great shot! Good composition, pose, lighting, DOF. And your model even has a typical "scientist face" with the glasses and all. ;-)  I was planning to do something similar, but didn''t have time in the end. I want to see this one on the front page!', '2008-06-11 02:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
