(4769864, 687344, 93386, '<td valign="top">The bottle dominates the composition. Don''t know if that is good or bad.</td>', 'The bottle dominates the composition. Don''t know if that is good or bad.', '2008-06-15 18:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
