(4769871, 685915, 93386, '<td valign="top">First thought is why an egg on ice. The ice looks like an abstract land-and-sky-scape.</td>', 'First thought is why an egg on ice. The ice looks like an abstract land-and-sky-scape.', '2008-06-15 18:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
