(4773890, 687500, 77192, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SoulMan1978:</b></div><hr/><i> Excellent. Top class. Maybe a ribbon? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Glad to see I can still pick out a ribbon :-) This was my favourite of the whole challenge. Great work Mr Maisano, you''re on sparkling form at the moment! (no pun intended)<br/> <br/>This would look great with a large print IMO. 640 pixels just doesn''t do it justice.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by SoulMan1978: Excellent. Top class. Maybe a ribbon?   Glad to see I can still pick out a ribbon :-) This was my favourite of the whole challenge. Great work Mr Maisano, you''re on sparkling form at the moment! (no pun intended) This would look great with a large print IMO. 640 pixels just doesn''t do it justice. ', '2008-06-18 03:38:41.000000', NULL, 0),
