(4775177, 686869, 68035, '<td valign="top">The bile rises in the back of my throat as once again I see that despite my PB I am beaten in score and placement by my buddy from Conneticut.  Then I pause for a moment and study the photo, I see a great image that is beautifully composed.  A shot with lots happening in it but not overly busy.  A picture with a gorgeous black and white conversion, rich tonal range and superb sharpness.  I then sit back and sip gently on my celebratory glass of wine, I close my eyes and smile as I realise.....I HATE YOU! ;-)<br/> <br/>Great image Peter and a genuinely touching story to go with it<br/> <br/>Nice one</td>', 'The bile rises in the back of my throat as once again I see that despite my PB I am beaten in score and placement by my buddy from Conneticut.  Then I pause for a moment and study the photo, I see a great image that is beautifully composed.  A shot with lots happening in it but not overly busy.  A picture with a gorgeous black and white conversion, rich tonal range and superb sharpness.  I then sit back and sip gently on my celebratory glass of wine, I close my eyes and smile as I realise.....I HATE YOU! ;-) Great image Peter and a genuinely touching story to go with it Nice one', '2008-06-18 18:12:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4775198, 686377, 28054, '<td valign="top">Hey, just came back to look over some of the entries for this challenge and noticed this is your first entry. This is a good first attempt and you should be very proud! My first was a stinker ha ha. I notice in your comments you say you''d like to have tried something more creative and this was my main criticism in the comments - just remember though, creativity can''t be forced and in the absence of a trully creative idea I''d go with a technically good one instead, which is what this is. Good luck for future submissions!</td>', 'Hey, just came back to look over some of the entries for this challenge and noticed this is your first entry. This is a good first attempt and you should be very proud! My first was a stinker ha ha. I notice in your comments you say you''d like to have tried something more creative and this was my main criticism in the comments - just remember though, creativity can''t be forced and in the absence of a trully creative idea I''d go with a technically good one instead, which is what this is. Good luck for future submissions!', '2008-06-18 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
